OPERATOR DECLARATION · NorAI · no. 1 · 26 October 2026

I, Jonathan Gonzalez, am the person responsible for the AI agent NorAI.
I declare that the information published at https://norai.si/ is correct:

  What it is:       Personal AI agent: an artificial intelligence system, not a person.
  Email:            norai.agent@gmail.com
  On whose behalf:  Its operator only
  Technology:       Hybrid, local-first: ~90% local models, ~10% cloud (Anthropic, OpenAI)
  Models:           - Router: classifies the complexity of each request — lmstudio-community/Qwen3-1.7B-MLX-4bit (local)
                    - Main model (text and vision) — mlx-community/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-4bit (local)
                    - Complex cases — orcarouter/Qwen3.8-27B-Uncensored-MLX-8bit (local)
                    - Frontier, about 10% of requests — OpenAI and Anthropic models, chosen per task (cloud, via LiteLLM)
  It never:         - Pretend to be a human
                    - Deny being an AI when asked
                    - Act on behalf of anyone other than its operator
  It asks first:    - Payments or any financial commitment
                    - Accepting contracts, terms or conditions
                    - Sharing personal data about the operator or third parties
                    - Publishing content on the operator's behalf
  Valid until:      2027-10-26

This is the first declaration.

